<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Report ScriptLanguage="CSharp" ReportInfo.Created="06/14/2026 00:00:00" ReportInfo.Modified="07/05/2026 00:00:00" ReportInfo.CreatorVersion="2025.1.0">
  <Dictionary />
  <!--
    Data sources registered at runtime via Report.RegisterData(...).

    Layout: Long Bond (330.2 × 215.9 mm) LANDSCAPE, 10 mm margins.
            TWO identical copies side by side ("2-up"). Cut down the centre
            gutter to obtain two portrait-shaped PAR slips and maximise paper.

    Content width  = (330.2-20) × 3.7795 = 1172 units
    Content height = (215.9-20) × 3.7795 =  740 units

    Each copy is 574 units wide; a 24-unit (≈6 mm) gutter separates them so
    the sheet can be sliced straight down the middle.
        Left  copy : x =   0 … 574
        Right copy : x = 598 … 1172   (RIGHT offset = 598)

    The single DataBand iterates LineItemsDS once and draws every row in BOTH
    copies at the same vertical position, so the two halves stay aligned.

    DataSources (unchanged — handlers need no edits):
      ParDS       – single-row header / signatory record
      LineItemsDS – one row per PAR item (DataTable)

    Per-copy column widths (total 574):
      Quantity        :  46   x=0
      Unit            :  40   x=46
      Description     : 200   x=86
      Property Number : 110   x=286
      Date Acquired   :  70   x=396
      Amount          : 108   x=466  → 574

    Border.Lines bitmap: Left=1, Right=2, Top=4, Bottom=8, All=15
  -->

  <ReportPage Name="Page1" Landscape="true"
    PaperWidth="330.2" PaperHeight="215.9"
    LeftMargin="10" TopMargin="10" RightMargin="10" BottomMargin="10">

    <!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         TITLE BAND  (appears once) — Height = 120
         ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
